OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785496710
OL,3,CCyanide-contaminated tomatoes may have
OL,4,Ckilled 15 elephants, Kenyan officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FWildlife officials say 15 elephants
OL,8,Fthat died in southern Kenya over the
OL,9,Fpast month are suspected to have been
OL,10,Fpoisoned by cyanide-contaminated
OL,11,Ftomatoes.
OL,13,FAuthorities did not say who they
OL,14,Fsuspected to be behind the
OL,15,Fcontamination of tomatoes from farms
OL,16,Fneighbouring the Amboseli National
OL,17,FPark.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
