OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785496710
OL,3,CCyanide-contaminated tomatoes may have
OL,4,Ckilled 15 elephants, Kenyan officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FIn the past, farmers have been
OL,8,Fsuspected of deliberately poisoning
OL,9,Felephants to prevent them from eating
OL,10,Fcrops.
OL,12,FThe park in southern Kenya borders an
OL,13,Farea where farming and the raising of
OL,14,Flivestock are prevalent.
OL,16,FKenya Wildlife Service director
OL,17,Fgeneral Erustus Kanga said preliminary
OL,18,Flaboratory tests detected cyanide,
OL,19,Ftelling local media that it is a
OL,20,F"highly toxic chemical, particularly
OL,21,Ffor elephants".
OL,26,@|D@AOU}D@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
