FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785496710
OL,3,CCyanide-contaminated tomatoes may have
OL,4,Ckilled 15 elephants, Kenyan officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FThe Kenya Wildlife Service warned that
OL,8,Fthe contamination could have wider
OL,9,Fconsequences because livestock also
OL,10,Fgraze in the area.
OL,12,F"Other than the elephants and the
OL,13,Fwildlife that may be feeding in those
OL,14,Ffields, we have the local livestock,"
OL,15,FMr Kanga said.
OL,17,F"We have the goats. We have the cattle
OL,18,Fthat are there. Eventually, if this is
OL,19,Ftruly what is in the system, then we
OL,20,Fare going to see a bigger impact."
OL,26,@tD@AOUvD@eO]yD@AOU|D@bO]
