OL,3,CCyanide-contaminated tomatoes may have
OL,4,Ckilled 15 elephants, Kenyan officials
OL,5,Csay
OL,7,FWildlife authorities said the toxic
OL,8,Fsubstances found in the deceased
OL,9,Felephants pose no immediate threat to
OL,10,Fhuman health.
